### Get all movies
GET http://localhost:3010/movies

### Get movie by ID
GET http://localhost:3010/movies/1

### Movie that does not exist
GET http://localhost:3010/movies/999

### Create a new movie,use GET http://localhost:3010/movies to test it
POST http://localhost:3010/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Blade Runner",
  "director": "Ridley Scott",
  "year": 1982
}

### Invalid movie
POST http://localhost:3010/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "director": "Nobody"
}

### Update a movie
PATCH http://localhost:3010/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2011
}

### Delete a movie
DELETE http://localhost:3010/movies/1